   1: # Multimedia Appendix 2. Year-specific KCHS↔NHANES harmonization crosswalk and the locked predictor-set amendment
   2: 
   3: Supports Methods §2.5 and §2.5.1. Section A documents how each harmonized variable was resolved in every KCHS survey year and in each NHANES cycle. Section B reproduces, in English, the predictor-set amendment that was written and locked before any model was fitted; the original Korean document (dated 2026-07-15) is included unchanged in the code release.
   4: 
   5: ---
   6: 
   7: ## A. Harmonization crosswalk
   8: 
   9: ### A.1 Outcome
