  14: 
  15: ### A.2 The 17 harmonized predictors
  16: 
  17: KCHS variable names are not stable across survey years; the pipeline resolves each concept per year, first by variable name and then by a label regular expression, and writes the resolved name to a crosswalk log (`results/qc_crosswalk.txt`). Predictors 15?17 are the amendment additions.
