  92:     print(f"  {nm:<20} slope={sl:.3f}  절편(기존)={ic:+.3f}  CITL(정식)={citl:+.3f}   │ 재보정후 slope={sl_r:.3f} CITL={citl_r:+.3f}", flush=True)
